                     Act (Alta.), [1987] 1 S.C.R. 313; Re B.C. Motor Vehicle Act, [1985] 2 S.C.R. 486; Wewaykum Indian Band v. Canada, 2003 SCC 45, [2003] 2 S.C.R. 259; <b>Miglin v. Miglin</b>, 2003 SCC 24, [2003] 1 S.C.R. 303; Yukon Francophone School Board, Education Area #23 v. Yukon (Attorney General), 2015 SCC 25, [2015] 2 S.C.R. 282; &nbsp;&nbsp;[...]&nbsp;&nbsp;[85] This Court has held that the reasonable and informed person has “knowledge of all the relevant circumstances” and “view[s] the matter realistically and practically” (<b>Miglin v. Miglin</b>, 2003 SCC 24, [2003] 1 S.C.R. 303, at para. 26, cited with approval in Yukon Francophone School Board, Education Area #23 v. Yukon 
                </p>
