                <p class="snippet" >
                     Corp. v. Gustafson, 2019 SKCA 78, 438 D.L.R. (4th) 387; Downer v. Pitcher, 2017 NLCA 13, 409 D.L.R. (4th) 542; Hodgkinson v. Simms, [1994] 3 S.C.R. 377; <b>Miglin v. Miglin</b>, 2003 SCC 24, [2003] 1 S.C.R. 303; Rick v. Brandsema, 2009 SCC 10, [2009] 1 S.C.R. 295; Dyck v. Manitoba Snowmobile Association, [1985] 1 S.C.R. 589; &nbsp;&nbsp;[...]&nbsp;&nbsp; vulnerability (Norberg, at pp. 256 and 261; Hodgkinson v. Simms, [1994] 3 S.C.R. 377, at p. 412; <b>Miglin v. Miglin</b>, 2003 SCC 24, [2003] 1 S.C.R. 303, at paras. 82, 86 and 93, per Bastarache and Arbour JJ., and para. 208, per LeBel J., dissenting; Rick v. Brandsema, 2009 SCC 10, [2009] 1 S.C.R. 295, at paras. 6 and 58). 
                </p>
